# Test and lint tooling only. Kept separate from agent/requirements.txt because
# nothing here runs in the weekly job.
#
# Hash-pinned, unlike the SAST scanner: this closure is five packages with no
# network clients and no telemetry stack in it. Vendoring semgrep's 66-package
# closure the same way is what dragged `mcp` and `opentelemetry-api` advisories
# into this repo's dependency graph, so semgrep runs from a digest-pinned image
# instead. The rule of thumb: pin a tool's closure only when the closure is
# small enough that you would read it.
pytest
ruff
